<div class="page">
  <h1 style="font-size: 18pt; margin-bottom: 10px;">Integral Orifice Flow Elements</h1>
  <h2 style="font-size: 14pt; margin-top: 0;">Model 1330L</h2>

  <h2 class="section-heading">Integral Orifice Flow Element</h2>
  <p style="font-size: 12pt;">1/2, 1, 1-1/2" Pipe sizes, Model 1330L</p>
  <p style="font-size: 12pt;">The integral orifice is a flow element capable of being close coupled with differential pressure transmitters to make a complete flow meter. It provides easy-to-install, low-cost measurement of the small flows found frequently in plant metering operations and research. It can be ordered with internal NPT threads or flanged pipe connections. The orifice assembly may be directly mounted to the transmitter or remote using optional adapter kit 155S711.</p>

  <h3 class="sub-heading">PERFORMANCE SPECIFICATIONS</h3>

  <table class="data-table" style="margin-top: 15px;">
    <tr>
      <th style="width: 50%;">Accuracy</th>
      <td style="width: 50%;"><span data-field="accuracy.value">{{ accuracy.value }}</span></td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  <h3 class="sub-heading">Uncalibrated Orifice Bores</h3>
  <table class="data-table">
    <tr>
      <th style="width: 30%;">Size</th>
      <th style="width: 35%;">Bore</th>
      <th style="width: 35%;">Tolerance</th>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><span data-field="bore_sizes.bore_1">{{ bore_sizes.bore_1 }}</span></td>
      <td><span data-field="bore_sizes.tolerance_1">{{ bore_sizes.tolerance_1 }}</span></td>
      <td></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><span data-field="bore_sizes.bore_2">{{ bore_sizes.bore_2 }}</span></td>
      <td><span data-field="bore_sizes.tolerance_2">{{ bore_sizes.tolerance_2 }}</span></td>
      <td></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><span data-field="bore_sizes.bore_3">{{ bore_sizes.bore_3 }}</span></td>
      <td><span data-field="bore_sizes.tolerance_3">{{ bore_sizes.tolerance_3 }}</span></td>
      <td></td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  <h3 class="sub-heading">Pressure Rating</h3>
  <table class="data-table">
    <tr>
      <th style="width: 30%;">Threaded</th>
      <td style="width: 70%;"><span data-field="pressure_rating.threaded_details">{{ pressure_rating.threaded_details }}</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <th style="width: 30%;"></th>
      <td style="width: 70%;"><span data-field="pressure_rating.threaded_details_2">{{ pressure_rating.threaded_details_2 }}</span></td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  <h3 class="sub-heading">Flanged</h3>
  <table class="data-table">
    <tr>
      <th style="width: 30%;"></th>
      <td style="width: 70%;"><span data-field="pressure_rating.flanged_details">{{ pressure_rating.flanged_details }}</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <th style="width: 30%;"></th>
      <td style="width: 70%;"><span data-field="pressure_rating.flanged_details_2">{{ pressure_rating.flanged_details_2 }}</span></td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  <h3 class="sub-heading">PHYSICAL SPECIFICATIONS</h3>
  <h4 style="font-size: 11pt; margin-top: 10px;">Materials of Construction</h4>
  <table class="data-table">
    <tr>
      <th style="width: 30%;">Threaded type body</th>
      <td>316 SST</td>
      <th style="width: 30%;">Orifice plate</th>
      <td>316 SST, Hastelloy-C°</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <th style="width: 30%;">Flanged type element</th>
      <td>All 316 SST only</td>
      <th style="width: 30%;">Sealing gasket</th>
      <td>Silicate ceramic filled TFE</td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  <h3 class="sub-heading">Concentric Orifice Bores</h3>
  <table class="data-table">
    <tr>
      <th style="width: 20%;">Size</th>
      <th style="width: 70%;">Bore Sizes (in.)</th>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>1/2 in.</td>
      <td><span data-field="concentric_bores.1_2_in">{{ concentric_bores.1_2_in }}</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>1 in.</td>
      <td><span data-field="concentric_bores.1_in">{{ concentric_bores.1_in }}</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>1-1/2 in.</td>
      <td><span data-field="concentric_bores.1_5_in">{{ concentric_bores.1_5_in }}</span></td>
    </tr>
  </table>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <h2 class="section-heading">DETERMINATION OF DIFFERENTIAL PRESSURE AND ORIFICE BORE</h2>
  <h3 class="sub-heading">Differential Pressure</h3>
  <p style="font-size: 12pt;">To calculate exact differential pressure produced at known flow rate, use one of the following equations:</p>

  <p style="font-size: 12pt;">Liquid: h = gf <span data-field="liquid_equation">{{ liquid_equation }}</span></p>
  <p style="font-size: 12pt;">Gas: h = <span data-field="gas_equation">{{ gas_equation }}</span></p>
  <p style="font-size: 12pt;">Steam: h = <span data-field="steam_equation">{{ steam_equation }}</span></p>

  <p style="font-size: 12pt;">d = <span data-field="definition.d">{{ definition.d }}</span></p>
  <p style="font-size: 12pt;">Fp = <span data-field="definition.fp">{{ definition.fp }}</span></p>
  <p style="font-size: 12pt;">Zf = <span data-field="definition.zf">{{ definition.zf }}</span></p>
  <p style="font-size: 12pt;">G = <span data-field="definition.g">{{ definition.g }}</span></p>
  <p style="font-size: 12pt;">gf = <span data-field="definition.gf">{{ definition.gf }}</span></p>
  <p style="font-size: 12pt;">h = <span data-field="definition.h">{{ definition.h }}</span></p>
  <p style="font-size: 12pt;">K = <span data-field="definition.k">{{ definition.k }}</span></p>
  <p style="font-size: 12pt;">Pv = <span data-field="definition.pv">{{ definition.pv }}</span></p>
  <p style="font-size: 12pt;">q = <span data-field="definition.q">{{ definition.q }}</span></p>
  <p style="font-size: 12pt;">Tf = <span data-field="definition.tf">{{ definition.tf }}</span></p>
  <p style="font-size: 12pt;">W = <span data-field="definition.w">{{ definition.w }}</span></p>
  <p style="font-size: 12pt;">Y = <span data-field="definition.y">{{ definition.y }}</span></p>

  <h3 class="sub-heading" style="margin-top: 30px;">Orifice Capacities</h3>

  <h4 style="font-size: 11pt; margin-top: 15px;">1/2 inch Integral Orifice Capacity Table</h4>
  <table class="data-table">
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th style="width: 15%;">Orifice Bore (inches)</th>
        <th style="width: 15%;">Differential Pressure (psig)</th>
        <th style="width: 15%;">Liquid Flow Rate (gpm)</th>
        <th style="width: 15%;">Gas Flow Rate (scfh)</th>
        <th style="width: 20%;">Saturated Steam Flow Rate (lb/hr)</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      {% for row in orifice_capacity_1_2_in %}
      <tr>
        <td><span data-field="orifice_capacity_1_2_in[{{ loop.index0 }}].bore">{{ orifice_capacity_1_2_in[loop.index0].bore }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="orifice_capacity_1_2_in[{{ loop.index0 }}].dp">{{ orifice_capacity_1_2_in[loop.index0].dp }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="orifice_capacity_1_2_in[{{ loop.index0 }}].liquid_flow">{{ orifice_capacity_1_2_in[loop.index0].liquid_flow }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="orifice_capacity_1_2_in[{{ loop.index0 }}].gas_flow">{{ orifice_capacity_1_2_in[loop.index0].gas_flow }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="orifice_capacity_1_2_in[{{ loop.index0 }}].steam_flow">{{ orifice_capacity_1_2_in[loop.index0].steam_flow }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      {% endfor %}
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <h4 style="font-size: 11pt; margin-top: 25px;">1-1/2 inch Integral Orifice Capacity Table</h4>
  <table class="data-table">
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th style="width: 15%;">Orifice Bore (inches)</th>
        <th style="width: 15%;">Differential Pressure (psig)</th>
        <th style="width: 15%;">Liquid Flow Rate (gpm)</th>
        <th style="width: 15%;">Gas Flow Rate (scfh)</th>
        <th style="width: 20%;">Saturated Steam Flow Rate (lb/hr)</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      {% for row in orifice_capacity_1_5_in %}
      <tr>
        <td><span data-field="orifice_capacity_1_5_in[{{ loop.index0 }}].bore">{{ orifice_capacity_1_5_in[loop.index0].bore }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="orifice_capacity_1_5_in[{{ loop.index0 }}].dp">{{ orifice_capacity_1_5_in[loop.index0].dp }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="orifice_capacity_1_5_in[{{ loop.index0 }}].liquid_flow">{{ orifice_capacity_1_5_in[loop.index0].liquid_flow }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="orifice_capacity_1_5_in[{{ loop.index0 }}].gas_flow">{{ orifice_capacity_1_5_in[loop.index0].gas_flow }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="orifice_capacity_1_5_in[{{ loop.index0 }}].steam_flow">{{ orifice_capacity_1_5_in[loop.index0].steam_flow }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      {% endfor %}
    </tbody>
  </table>
</div>

